Spec: SpecDD Known Sections

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Provide known SpecDD section lookup and typo suggestions for validation.

Owns:
  SpecDDKnownSections.kt

Can modify:
  SpecDDKnownSections.kt

Can read:
  ../parser/*
  ../../../../../../test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/validation/SpecDDKnownSectionsBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Mirror known section labels from shared language facts.
  Distinguish known section labels from unknown labels.
  Suggest the closest known section label only when edit distance is at most 2.
  Compare typo suggestions case-insensitively.
  Return no suggestion for unrelated labels.
  Return no suggestion for empty labels.
  Keep typo suggestion behavior deterministic.
  Cover known labels, unknown labels, likely typos, unrelated labels, and empty labels in tests.

Must not:
  Define section parsing order.
  Report validation diagnostics directly.
  Define highlighting colors.
  Change shared language facts.
